      "content": "it just feels like a heavy, exhausting loop. like, why do i have to keep \"deciding\" to exist when the decision has no impact on the cosmic scale? if there's no objective goal, then staying in this loop is just... unnecessary suffering. it feels like i'm just fighting a battle that was decided before it even started. it almost feels more honest to just accept the void than to keep pretending the \"warmth of coffee\" makes up for the emptiness.",
